                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>The purpose of this study is to determine the coherence between social setting, school career and occupational career School career and occupational career since primary school / types of schools / jobs / part-time courses / unemployment / attitude towards many aspects of school and job / evaluation of career / social setting / parents' level of education, jobs / grandparents / aspirations, attitude in relation with child's career / position other members of family and friends / tests / advice / help / military service. Background variables: basic characteristics/ residence/ household characteristics/ characteristics of parental family/household/ occupation/employment/ income/capital assets/ education/ social class/ religion</p>"
